    mc "（靠，他刹车就不能像正常人一样吗？）"

translate schinese welcome_c56e1eb8:

    # mc "Thanks for the ride."
    mc "谢谢你送我。"

translate schinese welcome_ed51cc20:

    # bodyguard "..."
    bodyguard "……"

translate schinese welcome_6b5f6616:

    # mc "Yeah, it was nice talking with you too."
    mc "嗯，跟你聊天也挺愉快的。"

translate schinese welcome_4c85d272:

    # mc "See ya!"
    mc "回见！"

translate schinese welcome_e3500962:

    # mc "(That guy didn't say a word during the entire ride. That was awkward as hell.)"
    mc "（那家伙整程一句话没说。尴尬死了。）"

translate schinese welcome_8f77b7b2:

    # mc "(At least I'm here in one piece. That's unbelievable considering how recklessly he was driving.)"
    mc "（至少我完好无损地到了。看他那么乱开车，简直不敢相信。）"

translate schinese welcome_5091ca63:

    # mc "(But man! This place looks excatly the same as I remember. Quite nostalgic.)"
    mc "（不过天啊！这地方和我记忆中一模一样。真怀旧。）"

translate schinese welcome_daa036bb:

    # mc "(I can't wait to see them already. Maybe they even prepared a welcome party for me?)"
    mc "（已经迫不及待想见她们了。她们该不会还给我准备了欢迎派对吧？）"

translate schinese welcome_0df1a8e0:

    # mc "..." with dis5
    mc "……" with dis5

translate schinese welcome_3dc577a2:

    # mc "(Hm? Nobody's at home?)"
    mc "（嗯？家里没人？）"

translate schinese welcome_0d335248:

    # mc "(Nah, that's impossible. They knew I'd come.)"
    mc "（不，不可能。她们知道我要来。）"

translate schinese welcome_81e6f3c8:

    # k "Easy, easy! I'm coming! No need to break down the damn door!" with hpunch
    k "别别别！我来了！不用把门拆了！" with hpunch

translate schinese welcome_cb447d5d:

    # k "What?!"
    k "什么？！"

translate schinese welcome_e716d272:

    # mc "Um, hi Kate."
    mc "呃，嗨，凯特。"

translate schinese welcome_e7877768:

    # k "Hi. Do I know you?"
    k "嗨。我们认识吗？"

translate schinese welcome_344d7c6a:

    # mc "I hope so. It's me, [mc]. Don't you remember me?"
    mc "希望认识。是我，[mc]。不记得我了？"

translate schinese welcome_3f23acf2:

    # k "[mc]...?"
    k "[mc]……？"

translate schinese welcome_ed361110:

    # k "Oh my god, [mc]!"
    k "我的天，[mc]！"

translate schinese welcome_6821c8c8:

    # k "It's you! It's really you! I didn't recognize you!" with dis5
    k "是你！真的是你！我都没认出来！" with dis5

translate schinese welcome_72907852:

    # k "Oh god, you've changed so much!"
    k "天哪，你变化好大！"

translate schinese welcome_f6a7c911:

    # k "Wow, you even gained some muscles. What happened to that little weakling I used to know?"
    k "哇，你居然还长肌肉了。我以前认识的那个小弱鸡呢？"

translate schinese welcome_cf9ea020:

    # k "Do you go to the gym?"
    k "你去健身房了？"

translate schinese welcome_ac0e4b01:

    # mc "Sometimes."
    mc "偶尔。"

translate schinese welcome_c840c4ef:

    # k "For real?! That's great! Me too! We can go together one time!"
    k "真的？！太好了！我也是！我们可以一起去一次！"

translate schinese welcome_70e1168d:

    # k "What do you think?"
    k "你觉得呢？"

translate schinese welcome_9d017512:

    # mc "I'm not saying no, but I'll think about it later, okay?"
    mc "我没说不去，不过让我再想想，好吗？"

translate schinese welcome_229c0c28:

    # k "Oh... right. My bad. Come inside or I'll end up planning the entire next month for you."
    k "哦……对哦。我的错。快进来吧，不然我得替接下来一整月做安排了。"

translate schinese welcome_4bcbca54:

    # k "I'm sorry for that mean welcome. Totally forgot you were coming today." with dis5
    k "抱歉刚才那么凶。完全忘了你今天要来。" with dis5

translate schinese welcome_74a5e553:

    # mc "Don't worry. It's not like I was expecting a surprise party."
    mc "没事。我又不是真在等什么惊喜派对。"

translate schinese welcome_d5b94c4f:

    # mc "(Not at all...{i}*sob*{/i})"
    mc "（完全没在等……{i}*抽泣*{/i}）"

translate schinese welcome_8c08a4fe:

    # k "Hmm? Were you?"
    k "嗯？你在等吗？"

translate schinese welcome_6ddddd1f:

    # mc "Maybe..."
    mc "也许吧……"

translate schinese welcome_d123723d:

    # k "Haha, sorry, we didn't prepare anything special."
    k "哈哈，抱歉，我们没准备什么特别的。"

translate schinese welcome_3fe16bc8:

    # k "But look on the bright side. A beautiful girl welcomed you at the door. Consider it a welcome gift."
    k "但换个角度想，一位美女在门口迎接了你。就当是见面礼吧。"

translate schinese welcome_c1891a57:

    # k "Unless..."
    k "除非……"

translate schinese welcome_eb9ff3a0:

    # k "Maybe there's something else I could do for you? Do you have any ideas?"
    k "也许我还能为你做点别的？你有什么想法吗？"

translate schinese welcome_72ae3366:

    # mc "You know, I might have some {i}really nice{/i} idea, if you know what I mean."
    mc "你知道吗，如果你懂我意思的话，我也许有个{i}很棒的{/i}主意。"

translate schinese welcome_ff1231ca:

    # k "Ugh, the worst possible answer."
    k "呃，最糟糕的答案。"

translate schinese welcome_1750e45c:

    # k "Can't you see when a girl is just kidding?"
    k "你看不出女孩子只是在开玩笑吗？"

translate schinese welcome_4f2ac0bb:

    # mc "O-of course I can!"
    mc "我、我当然看得出！"

translate schinese welcome_e7b2b583:

    # mc "I was just kidding too."
    mc "我只是在开玩笑而已。"

translate schinese welcome_bc7be65f:

    # k "Yeah yeah, sure."
    k "是是是，对对对。"

translate schinese welcome_6391d1a3:

    # mc "Wow wow, wait... w-what are you talking about?"
    mc "哇哇，等等……你、你在说什么？"

translate schinese welcome_5348e57b:

    # mc "Did you mean...?"
    mc "你是说……？"

translate schinese welcome_e695a095:

    # k "Haha, relax, I was just kidding."
    k "哈哈，放心吧，我只是开玩笑。"

translate schinese welcome_849e56fb:

    # k "At first I thought you changed so much, but it looks like you are still the same person."
    k "一开始我以为你变了很多，但看起来你还是老样子。"

translate schinese welcome_df9e262a:

    # k "It's still fun to tease you."
    k "逗你依然很好玩。"

translate schinese welcome_1b1cf9b6:

    # mc "Oh come on! Who would say something like that in such a suggestive way?"
    mc "得了吧！谁会用这么暗示的说法啊？"

translate schinese welcome_53396eb3:

    # mc "I just didn't expect that."
    mc "我只是没想到。"

translate schinese welcome_d4024cba:

    # k "That's why it was so funny."
    k "所以才好笑啊。"

translate schinese welcome_4c9c3cea:

    # mc "But now I remember. You always liked to tease me. Next time I'll be more vigilant."
    mc "不过我现在想起来了。你以前就喜欢逗我。下次我会提高警惕的。"

translate schinese welcome_dd3be873:

    # k "Sorry, sorry, but I had to. You have no idea how much I missed that."
    k "抱歉抱歉，但我忍不住。你根本不知道我有多怀念这样逗你。"

translate schinese welcome_82ccf482:

    # k "But I'm glad that you didn't change that much."
    k "不过我很高兴你没有变太多。"

translate schinese welcome_600e33e3:

    # mc "Nope. And you? Any ideas?"
    mc "没有。那你呢？有什么主意？"

translate schinese welcome_50bf334c:

    # k "Oh? That's surprising. I thought you'd be more nervous. There was a time when you would even blush instantly."
    k "哦？这倒出乎意料。我还以为你会更紧张呢。以前你可是会立刻脸红的。"

translate schinese welcome_c65b5631:

    # k "Looks like you really grew up a little, huh?"
    k "看来你真的长大了一点呢。"

translate schinese welcome_97735269:

    # mc "Well, it has been a while."
    mc "嗯，毕竟过了很久了。"

translate schinese welcome_536ef8a4:

    # k "Yeah, you're right."
    k "嗯，你说得对。"

translate schinese welcome_d029e5e3:

    # k "Shame. I was hoping you hadn't changed that much."
    k "真可惜。我还希望你别变这么多呢。"

translate schinese welcome_d1b0ecef:

    # mc "Maybe you'll be able to get me next time."
    mc "说不定下次你就能得手了。"

translate schinese welcome_2e6bc384:

    # k "Yeah, maybe."
    k "嗯，也许吧。"

translate schinese welcome_ac1b210f:

    # k "Anyway, follow me. I'll show you your room." with dis5
    k "总之，跟我来。我带你去你的房间。" with dis5

translate schinese welcome_8da27e8b:

    # mc "(This place didn't change that much. It's so nostalgic.)"
    mc "（这地方没怎么变。好怀旧。）"

translate schinese welcome_a0bdabc3:

    # mc "Alice isn't at home?"
    mc "爱丽丝不在家？"

translate schinese welcome_0d19e15a:

    # k "I don't know, she should be."
    k "不知道啊，应该在的。"

translate schinese welcome_b888e1e4:

    # k "I didn't see her today but she's probably sleeping or playing and didn't hear you breaking the door down."
    k "我今天没看到她，不过她大概在睡觉或者打游戏，没听见你砸门。"

translate schinese welcome_7fe24f9a:

    # k "Just give her time. She will eventually emerge from her cave."
    k "给她点时间吧，她迟早会从洞里钻出来。"

translate schinese welcome_23538437:

    # k "Why're you asking? Can't wait to see her?"
    k "你问这个干嘛？等不及要见她了？"

translate schinese welcome_8bf791ea:

    # mc "Just like I couldn't wait to see you."
    mc "就像我等不及要见你一样。"

translate schinese welcome_54c0b1f5:

    # k "Charming. Come upstairs."
    k "真会说话。上楼吧。"

translate schinese welcome_65ede88e:

    # mc "(Oh? Classic stairs view. Mhmm mhmm, very nice Kate. 10 out of 10.)"
    mc "（哦？经典楼梯视角。嗯嗯，很好很好，漂亮的凯特。满分十分。）"

translate schinese welcome_b9848f39:

    # mc "(You can immediatly see that she is exercising a lot.)"
    mc "（一眼就能看出她练得很多。）"

translate schinese welcome_1e7294be:

    # mc "(How am I suppose to live here, having such a nice view every day?)"
    mc "（我以后要是住这儿，每天都能看到这种景色，该怎么活啊？）"

translate schinese welcome_97ce465a:

    # k "What are you looking at?"
    k "你看什么呢？"

translate schinese welcome_9863c06a:

    # mc "I, err... was looking at your ass. Sorry."
    mc "我，那个……在看你屁股。抱歉。"

translate schinese welcome_4b0284dd:

    # k "Haha, can't believe you actually said that."
    k "哈哈，真没想到你真说出来了。"

translate schinese welcome_520b79f0:

    # k "That's what I thought. But don't worry, I don't mind." with dis5
    k "我也猜到了。不过别担心，我不介意。" with dis5

translate schinese welcome_7c643066:

    # k "I didn't work out so much just to cover up my body, you know? I like it and I'm proud of it."
    k "我练这么久可不是为了把身体藏起来哦。我喜欢它，也为它骄傲。"

translate schinese welcome_06a5eb36:

    # mc "I can clearly see why. So in other words, you want to say that I have a permission?"
    mc "我完全看得出。所以你的意思是，我得到许可了？"

translate schinese welcome_b61d545e:

    # k "Only if it won't be as ostentatious as it was now. That was a little too much."
    k "只要不像刚才那么招摇就行。刚才有点过了。"

translate schinese welcome_f7cae298:

    # mc "Thank you, oh, generous lady."
    mc "谢谢您，慷慨的女士。"

translate schinese welcome_b8c6e795:

    # k "You're welcome."
    k "不客气。"

translate schinese welcome_41ad2725:

    # mc "I, err... you know... at the stairs. So I don't fall down."
    mc "我，那个……你看……在楼梯上。以免我摔下去。"

translate schinese welcome_f66ebd38:

    # k "Mhmm, at the stairs? You sure about that?"
    k "嗯，在楼梯上？你确定？"

translate schinese welcome_1bf60051:

    # mc "Of course."
    mc "当然。"

translate schinese welcome_9af147e5:

    # k "Well, in that case, next time don't stare at them so intently."
    k "那样的话，下次别盯得那么认真。"

translate schinese welcome_aa302f29:

    # k "They may not like it."
    k "它们可能会不高兴。"

translate schinese welcome_c9ce2722:

    # k "Come this way."
    k "这边走。"

translate schinese welcome_a9a6e52c:

    # k "That's your room."
    k "那就是你的房间。"

translate schinese welcome_b7f81df5:

    # k "Alice's room is next to yours, so at nights you might hear her insulting people online. Don't worry, it's normal."
    k "爱丽丝的房间就在你隔壁，晚上你可能会听到她在网上骂人。别担心，很正常。"

translate schinese welcome_a25ff84b:

    # k "Don't hesitate and feel free to scold her. That should give you enough time to fall asleep in peace."
    k "别客气，尽管训她。这样你就够时间安稳睡着了。"

translate schinese welcome_701d94f2:

    # mc "Thanks, I'll remember that."
    mc "谢了，我会记住的。"

translate schinese welcome_154d40f7:

    # k "Great. So go ahead and make yourself comfortable."
    k "很好。那就随意，当自己家一样。"

translate schinese welcome_606e2d02:

    # mc "Sure."
    mc "好。"

translate schinese welcome_5b09194f:

    # mc "It looks really-{p=0.5}{nw}"
    mc "它看起来真的——{p=0.5}{nw}"

translate schinese welcome_ae8af434:

    # mc "Whoa...!"
    mc "哇……！"

translate schinese welcome_9fc25fec:

    # k "Haha, I just remembered how funny it was!"
    k "哈哈哈，我刚想起来有多好笑！"

translate schinese welcome_efd8ab4a:

    # mc "Yeah me too... "
    mc "我也是……"

translate schinese welcome_c26d56fb:

    # mc "But I'm not so sure it is that funny from my side."
    mc "不过从我这边看，可没那么好笑。"

translate schinese welcome_e6d130d5:

    # k "Don't worry. I'm not a kid anymore so I won't beat you like I used to. That was just friendly hit."
    k "别担心。我已经不是小孩子了，不会像以前那样揍你。刚才是友情的碰一下。"

translate schinese welcome_51462506:

    # k "But it still feels the same. So nostalgic. You have no idea how much I've missed that."
    k "但感觉还是一样。真怀旧。你根本不知道我有多怀念这样。"

translate schinese welcome_49fdf4da:

    # k "You know, I have this feeling that with you at home I won't be bored at all."
    k "你知道吗，我有种感觉，家里有你在，我肯定不会无聊。"

translate schinese welcome_ac5717c8:

    # mc "Me too, Kate."
    mc "我也是，凯特。"

translate schinese welcome_752ef637:

    # k "Come down later. We'll make up for lost time."
    k "等会儿下来。我们把落下的都补上。"

translate schinese welcome_606e2d02_1:

    # mc "Sure."
    mc "好。"

translate schinese welcome_07ad156d:

    # mc "(What an energetic girl. She hasn't changed at all.)"
    mc "（真是个精力充沛的女孩。她一点都没变。）"

translate schinese welcome_be3aaa14:

    # mc "(Well, except for her butt. That changed quite a bit.)"
    mc "（嗯，除了她的屁股，那个变化挺大的。）"

translate schinese welcome_8abe23f2:

    # mc "(But that hit? Man, it really takes me back. She used to hit me often like that, when we were kids.)"
    mc "（不过刚才那一下？天哪，真让人怀旧。小时候她经常这么打我。）"

translate schinese welcome_54477925:

    # mc "(Back then it pissed me off, but now it's kinda nostalgic, just like she said.)"
    mc "（那时候我气得要死，但现在确实有点怀旧了，就像她说的那样。）"

translate schinese welcome_1aec6042:

    # mc "(So this is my room, huh?)"
    mc "（所以这就是我的房间了？）"

translate schinese welcome_00ecc2af:

    # mc "(Only the most necessary things. They probably took out all of their personal belongings before I arrived.)"
    mc "（只有最必要的东西。他们大概在我来之前把自己的私人物品都收走了。）"

translate schinese welcome_36a61bfb:

    # mc "(Maybe I'll hang some posters or buy decorations?)"
    mc "（也许我该挂几张海报，或者买些装饰？）"

translate schinese welcome_2b862e38:

    # mc "(Over time, I'll definitely get something. It will be cozier.)"
    mc "（慢慢的我肯定会添点东西的，会更温馨。）"

translate schinese welcome_89562ec8:

    # mc "New life, huh?"
    mc "新生活啊……"

translate schinese welcome_4be9cc7f:

    # mc "I wonder what it will be like?"
    mc "不知道会是什么样呢？"

translate schinese welcome_9ac43129:

    # mc "Shit, I fell asleep."
    mc "靠，我睡着了。"

translate schinese welcome_2a599017:

    # mc "(Maybe that gorilla chauffeur tired me out with all of his talking...)"
    mc "（也许是那个大猩猩司机一路说个不停，把我累着了……）"

translate schinese welcome_1703ff1d:

    # mc "(Oh right, Kate told me to come down to see her. I hope she's still there.)"
    mc "（哦对，凯特叫我下楼去找她。希望她还在。）"

translate schinese welcome_99f8f6ab:

    # mc "(There she is.)"
    mc "（她在那儿。）"

translate schinese welcome_78c0b4a8:

    # k "Well, well. Look who finally showed up. You felt so good that you didn't want to come down?"
    k "哎呀哎呀。看看这是谁终于出现了。舒服得不想下楼了？"

translate schinese welcome_58a48468:

    # mc "Yeah, that bed was definitely too comfortable."
    mc "嗯，那床实在太舒服了。"

translate schinese welcome_b019852a:

    # k "Ah, so you were sleeping. Rough night?"
    k "啊，所以你睡着了。昨晚很难受？"

translate schinese welcome_45b8919b:

    # mc "Nah, I don't know how that happened. I laid down for a while and when I opened my eyes, it turned out that more than just a moment had passed."
    mc "没有，我也不知道怎么回事。我躺了一会儿，睁开眼才发现过了不止一会儿。"

translate schinese welcome_6e1fac01:

    # k "Looks like you and Alice have something in common, then. It happens to her almost everyday."
    k "看来你和爱丽丝有一样的毛病。她几乎每天都这样。"

translate schinese welcome_731b5004:

    # k "Now that you're here, will you join me?"
    k "现在你来了，愿意陪我玩吗？"

translate schinese welcome_5963fec3:

    # mc "Sure. Are we watching something?"
    mc "好啊。我们看什么？"

translate schinese welcome_3a88e4f5:

    # k "No, there's nothing interesting anyway. Let's talk."
    k "不，反正也没什么好看的。聊聊天吧。"

translate schinese welcome_eaa8ee47:

    # mc "About what?"
    mc "聊什么？"

translate schinese welcome_dedc0529:

    # k "I don't know, nothing special. We haven't seen each other for so long, so just tell me something about you."
    k "不知道，也没什么特别的。我们那么久没见了，随便说点关于你的事吧。"

translate schinese welcome_fb1466c3:

    # k "How have you been? What you've been doing? How are you now?"
    k "你过得怎么样？都在做什么？现在是什么样？"

translate schinese welcome_7bd7fc55:

    # k "I want to know everything."
    k "我什么都想知道。"

translate schinese welcome_d68ff2d2:

    # mc "Well... I think your dad has already told you a little about how I am right now."
    mc "嗯……我想你爸爸已经跟你稍微说了一点我现在的情况。"

translate schinese welcome_93b38170:

    # k "Oh, right. That wasn't a good question."
    k "哦，对哦。这问题问得不好。"

translate schinese welcome_f53df9cb:

    # k "I'm sorry [mc]. I didn't want to make you feel bad."
    k "对不起，[mc]。我不是想让你难过。"

translate schinese welcome_4cb43ee6:

    # k "I can't even imagine how are you feeling right now. It must be hard."
    k "我根本无法想象你现在有多难受。一定很不容易。"

translate schinese welcome_7973d53a:

    # mc "Don't worry Kate. I'm fine, really."
    mc "别担心，凯特。我真的没事。"

translate schinese welcome_39fbc973:

    # k "You sure?"
    k "你确定？"

translate schinese welcome_41e1597c:

    # mc "Yeah, let's just... talk about something else. I don't want to spoil the mood."
    mc "嗯，我们……聊点别的吧。我不想破坏气氛。"

translate schinese welcome_8f6e0285:

    # mc "Anyway, since I already mentioned him, where is your Dad? I'd like to say hello."
    mc "话说回来，既然提到他了，你爸在哪儿？我想跟他打个招呼。"

translate schinese welcome_f7e3c692:

    # k "Oh, he's not home."
    k "哦，他不在家。"

translate schinese welcome_05f54861:

    # mc "Work?"
    mc "上班？"

translate schinese welcome_73e15472:

    # k "Yeah. I don't know when he'll be back, but he said to take care of you."
    k "嗯。不知道他什么时候回来，不过他说让我照顾好你。"

translate schinese welcome_6faa4358:

    # k "You can say hello to him when he returns."
    k "等他回来你再跟他问好吧。"

translate schinese welcome_5634b940:

    # k "Although you can probably guess how infrequently he comes home since he worked together with your parents."
    k "不过你大概也能猜到他多难得回一次家，毕竟他和你父母是同事。"

translate schinese welcome_a02e6341:

    # mc "Yeah, I can. And what about your Mom?"
    mc "嗯，我猜得到。那你妈呢？"

translate schinese welcome_c1c0581c:

    # k "Oh, you don't know? My parents divorced."
    k "哦，你不知道吗？我父母离婚了。"

translate schinese welcome_7a2522f9:

    # mc "Really? That's news to me."
    mc "真的？这我还真没听说过。"

translate schinese welcome_89a489d3:

    # k "Yeah, it happened a few years ago. Don't remember when exactly. She's not living with us."
    k "嗯，几年前的事了。具体什么时候我记不清了。她没和我们住。"

translate schinese welcome_d6741d8d:

    # mc "Oh, I get it. I'm sorry."
    mc "哦，我明白了。抱歉。"

translate schinese welcome_a88aa078:

    # k "Don't be sorry. There was no drama and Mom still lives nearby, so we can visit her whenever we want."
    k "不用道歉。没什么狗血的事，妈妈也还住在附近，我们想去看就去看。"

translate schinese welcome_9b9d4bb1:

    # k "Oh, that reminds me. She knows you're staying here and told us to bring you over as soon as we get the chance."
    k "哦，说起来。她知道你要住这儿，让我们有机会就带你过去。"

translate schinese welcome_92793682:

    # mc "That's great. I'd like to see her."
    mc "太好了。我想去见见她。"

translate schinese welcome_347eab22:

    # k "I bet she won't recognize you either."
    k "我敢说她大概也认不出你。"

translate schinese welcome_95133f80:

    # mc "Nah, you're the only one who couldn't."
    mc "不，只有你认不出。"

translate schinese welcome_3c2359d4:

    # k "That's not true. We'll see if Alice can do it."
    k "才不是。我们看看爱丽丝行不行。"

translate schinese welcome_b2b550a3:

    # k "Oh, speak of devil. The other sleepyhead is up."
    k "哦，说曹操曹操到。另一个小懒虫醒了。"

translate schinese welcome_ce8b76d8:

    # a "Huh? [mc]?"
    a "嗯？[mc]？"

translate schinese welcome_f86648d1:

    # mc "Hi Alice!"
    mc "嗨，爱丽丝！"

translate schinese welcome_207270c4:

    # a "[mc], it's really you. I'm so happy to see you. Come here."
    a "[mc]，真的是你。见到你太开心了。过来。"

translate schinese welcome_4da760b6:

    # a "How are you? Everything's okay?" with dis5
    a "你还好吗？一切都还好吧？" with dis5

translate schinese welcome_8dea7589:

    # mc "Yeah, I'm fine."
    mc "嗯，我挺好的。"

translate schinese welcome_7ca1e6aa:

    # a "You sure?"
    a "确定吗？"

translate schinese welcome_1119c998:

    # mc "Yes, Alice. Don't worry."
    mc "是的，爱丽丝。别担心。"

translate schinese welcome_5bd436ac:

    # a "Okay then. But if you'll need anything feel free to ask me anytime."
    a "那就好。不过有什么需要，尽管随时找我。"

translate schinese welcome_a64e8bc0:

    # mc "Thanks."
    mc "谢了。"

translate schinese welcome_e6ba5cbd:

    # mc "(Alice always was caring and kind. I'm so happy to see her again.)"
    mc "（爱丽丝一直都很体贴善良。能再见到她，我真高兴。）"

translate schinese welcome_e9cb3e5e:

    # mc "(But those I don't remember. The change is HUGE.)"
    mc "（但那两点我完全不记得。变化太大了。）"

translate schinese welcome_f816492c:

    # mc "(She definitely wasn't like that before.)"
    mc "（她以前绝对不是这样的。）"

translate schinese welcome_ade93550:

    # k "Hey, how the hell did you recognize him?"
    k "喂，你到底是怎么认出他的？"

translate schinese welcome_69d23d41:

    # a "How could I not? He didn't change that much."
    a "怎么可能认不出？他没怎么变。"

translate schinese welcome_0c0ff2b4:

    # k "For real? I almost chased him out when I opened the door."
    k "真的？我开门的时候差点把他赶出去。"

translate schinese welcome_9779a95a:

    # a "That doesn't surprise me. Sometimes you even barely recognize me when I leave my room."
    a "我一点也不意外。有时候我出房间，你都认不出我。"

translate schinese welcome_97db0d99:

    # k "Can you blame me? You look like a zombie with those dark bags under your eyes."
    k "能怪我吗？你那黑眼圈，活像个僵尸。"

translate schinese welcome_60a3c8a5:

    # a "And how am I suppose to look after a sleepless night?"
    a "那我熬了一整夜还能有好脸色吗？"

translate schinese welcome_80890240:

    # k "I bet that this time you slept on purpose before [mc] arrived so that he wouldn't see you like that."
    k "我敢说这次你是故意在 [mc] 来之前就睡下，好让他看不到你这副样子。"

translate schinese welcome_3e3a65f4:

    # a "Wrong. I totally forgot he was coming today. I slept in because I stayed up until the sun came up."
    a "错。我完全忘了他今天要来。我补觉是因为我熬到了天亮。"

translate schinese welcome_85354a62:

    # mc "You haven't sleep all night? Why?"
    mc "你一整夜没睡？为什么？"

translate schinese welcome_18bc1f8a:

    # a "I was playing."
    a "我在玩。"

translate schinese welcome_ecb25c66:

    # mc "Playing? You mean video games?"
    mc "玩？电子游戏？"

translate schinese welcome_210c06eb:

    # a "Yes."
    a "对。"

translate schinese welcome_33a05faf:

    # mc "What, are you a gamer now?"
    mc "怎么，你现在成游戏宅了？"

translate schinese welcome_7f38ed77:

    # a "Well, I guess you can say that. I'm pretty good, you know? Wanna see?"
    a "嗯，这么说也没错。我玩得很好的哦。要看吗？"

translate schinese welcome_d57bddf5:

    # mc "Hmm... Yeah, why not?"
    mc "嗯……好啊，为什么不呢。"

translate schinese welcome_2843309e:

    # a "And that's what I want to hear. Kate you're playing with us, right? Just like in the old days."
    a "这正是我想听的。凯特，你也一起来玩吧？就像以前那样。"

translate schinese welcome_48973916:

    # k "No Alice, I'll pass. Maybe another day."
    k "不了爱丽丝，我不了。改天吧。"

translate schinese welcome_d293878e:

    # k "If I stay here, you'll keep me up late and I have to get up early tomorrow."
    k "我要是留下，你们肯定又要熬到很晚，而我明天还得早起。"

translate schinese welcome_cc98c465:

    # k "Have fun you two."
    k "你们玩得开心。"

translate schinese welcome_b172ea67:

    # a "Looks like it's just the two of us then."
    a "看来就我们两个了。"

translate schinese welcome_8cb6daf1:

    # a "So... are you glad that you'll be living with us?"
    a "那么……你开心自己要和我们一起住吗？"

translate schinese welcome_f2a59416:

    # mc "Of course I am."
    mc "当然开心。"

translate schinese welcome_f1a57775:

    # mc "You know how for the most of my life I was alone, right? I feel like this will be a nice change."
    mc "你知道我大部分人生都是一个人过的吧？我觉得这会是个不错的改变。"

translate schinese welcome_e0ce0ecf:

    # a "By alone you mean... lonely?"
    a "你说的一个人，是指……寂寞吗？"

translate schinese welcome_543f003a:

    # mc "No, not lonely. Just... alone."
    mc "不，不是寂寞。只是……一个人。"

translate schinese welcome_33328dee:

    # mc "But when I got your invitation I thought that it was a great opportunity to not be alone any more."
    mc "但收到你们的邀请时，我觉得这是个不用再一个人待着的好机会。"

translate schinese welcome_de0ca148:

    # a "I see. Well, I have no idea if Kate and I will be the best roommates, but we will try to make you feel at home here."
    a "我明白了。嗯，我也不知道我和凯特会不会是最好的室友，但我们会尽量让你在这里有家的感觉。"

translate schinese welcome_3ac5d8b1:

    # mc "Thanks, Alice."
    mc "谢谢你，爱丽丝。"

translate schinese welcome_68fca16d:

    # a "Hey hey, what's wrong? You're loosing already!"
    a "喂喂，怎么回事？你已经输了！"

translate schinese welcome_8e1e261a:

    # mc "Game is not over yet. Keep playing."
    mc "游戏还没完。继续。"

translate schinese welcome_e8ec474c:

    # a "Oh, by the way, my room is across yours, so feel free to come over if you can't sleep at night."
    a "哦对了，我房间在你对面，晚上睡不着的话随时可以过来。"

translate schinese welcome_5f264a6b:

    # mc "If you shout at the computer, I'll definitely come over."
    mc "要是你对电脑大喊大叫，我一定过来。"

translate schinese welcome_c340a11c:

    # a "Hey! I don't shout at the computer!"
    a "喂！我才不吼电脑！"

translate schinese welcome_1cb01309:

    # mc "Kate already sold you out."
    mc "凯特已经把你卖了。"

translate schinese welcome_134f491c:

    # a "Oh yeah? And she makes noises with her stupid dumbbells during the day. It's impossible to sleep."
    a "是吗？那她白天还举着那对破哑铃弄出响声呢，根本没法睡。"

translate schinese welcome_6ecec4b8:

    # mc "You know, most people don't sleep during the day."
    mc "你知道吗，大多数人白天是不睡觉的。"

translate schinese welcome_969e9fd4:

    # a "It's the holidays. Why shouldn't I sleep during the day?"
    a "放假诶。我白天为什么不能睡？"

translate schinese welcome_e3639fbc:

    # mc "Well, I guess you're right."
    mc "嗯……好像你说得对。"

translate schinese welcome_7430c236:

    # mc "Ugh, looks like I lost."
    mc "呃，看来我输了。"

translate schinese welcome_04ef4181:

    # a "You gave me a head start, didn't you?"
    a "你让我先手了，对吧？"

translate schinese welcome_b6fc0f6a:

    # mc "What? No. I didn't."
    mc "什么？没有啊。"

translate schinese welcome_899ad440:

    # a "I saw you do it. Next round play seriously, understand? I hate it when someone does that."
    a "我看见了。下一局认真点，明白吗？我最讨厌别人这样。"

translate schinese welcome_26778276:

    # mc "Okay, okay, sorry."
    mc "好好好，抱歉。"

translate schinese welcome_64326223:

    # mc "I'll crush you now."
    mc "这局我要碾压你。"

translate schinese welcome_ddbbc95c:

    # a "We'll see."
    a "走着瞧。"

translate schinese welcome_a7330be7:

    # a "Yaaay! I win!"
    a "耶——！我赢了！"

translate schinese welcome_f47316e8:

    # mc "Damn, you're really good."
    mc "靠，你真的很强。"

translate schinese welcome_f7967f5f:

    # a "Told you. I didn't spent so much time on games to lose to you now."
    a "说过了。我花那么多时间打游戏，可不是现在输给你的。"

translate schinese welcome_97f7e2a0:

    # mc "Yeah, you just mercilessly shattered all my hopes and dreams."
    mc "是啊，你毫无留情地粉碎了我所有的希望与梦想。"

translate schinese welcome_0db7345d:

    # a "Haha, sorry. Next time I'll try to be more merciful."
    a "哈哈，抱歉。下次我会手下留情一点的。"

translate schinese welcome_a2f0282d:

    # a "Let's play something else. Maybe you'll do better."
    a "换个玩吧。也许你表现会好一点。"

translate schinese welcome_d23e814e:

    # mc "Bring it on."
    mc "来啊。"

translate schinese first_day_6cda0d73:

    # a "Good morning." with dis
    a "早安。" with dis

translate schinese first_day_31e993b8:

    # mc "Hi Alice."
    mc "嗨，爱丽丝。"

translate schinese first_day_a0d15c2b:

    # a "Slept well?"
    a "睡得好吗？"

translate schinese first_day_9221f517:

    # mc "Yeah, but my shoulder kinda hurts."
    mc "嗯，但肩膀有点疼。"

translate schinese first_day_b575a491:

    # mc "Feels like something's been weighing on it all night."
    mc "感觉像有什么东西压了一整夜。"

translate schinese first_day_f1237717:

    # a "W-well that's strange."
    a "咦，那奇怪了。"

translate schinese first_day_ddf95d57:

    # a "I slept on this couch so many times, and my shoulders were ok."
    a "我在这沙发上睡过那么多次，肩膀都没事。"

translate schinese first_day_48a08348:

    # a "Anyway, come and eat. I made some sandwiches."
    a "总之，过来吃吧。我做了三明治。"

translate schinese first_day_51376937:

    # mc "For me? You didn't have to. Thanks."
    mc "给我的？你不用特意做。谢谢。"

translate schinese first_day_40c93c1a:

    # a "Want something to drink? Coffee, tea?"
    a "要喝点什么吗？咖啡还是茶？"

translate schinese first_day_bf142524:

    # mc "Coffee, please."
    mc "咖啡，谢谢。"

translate schinese first_day_34c6e3ef:

    # a "Coming right up."
    a "马上来。"

translate schinese first_day_ccd382ee:

    # a "Here."
    a "给。"

translate schinese first_day_a64e8bc0:

    # mc "Thanks."
    mc "谢了。"

translate schinese first_day_255a0408:

    # mc "I didn't expect such treatment. Feels like I'm some kind of important guest or something."
    mc "没想到待遇这么好，搞得我像什么重要客人似的。"

translate schinese first_day_678ff2ae:

    # a "Just don't get used to it. I'm only trying to make a good first impression as the new roomie."
    a "别习惯。我只是想给新室友留个好印象。"

translate schinese first_day_7a6c4495:

    # mc "So... no more treatment like this later on?"
    mc "所以……以后就没这种待遇了？"

translate schinese first_day_2757992e:

    # a "Nope."
    a "没了。"

translate schinese first_day_78874975:

    # mc "Boo. Too bad. Having someone cook for me every morning is one of my dreams, you know?"
    mc "呜，太可惜了。你知道吗，每天早上有人给我做饭可是我的梦想之一。"

translate schinese first_day_69c42454:

    # a "Good luck with finding someone who'll fulfill that dream then."
    a "那祝你好运，能找到实现这个梦想的人吧。"

translate schinese first_day_b6d992c7:

    # a "I have a hard enough time preparing something for myself, let alone for others."
    a "我光是给自己弄点吃的都够费劲了，更别说给别人做。"

translate schinese first_day_abef5f4e:

    # a "Try asking Kate. Maybe she'll help you with that. Assuming of course you're into daily protein shakes."
    a "试试去问凯特吧，也许她能帮你。当然，前提是你不介意每天喝蛋白粉。"

translate schinese first_day_622e39cd:

    # mc "Well... no. I prefer your sandwiches."
    mc "嗯……不用。我还是更喜欢你的三明治。"

translate schinese first_day_7a8c1730:

    # a "Thought so."
    a "我就知道。"

translate schinese first_day_3857b67c:

    # a "Anyway, have any plans for today?"
    a "话说，今天有什么计划吗？"

translate schinese first_day_30756cba:

    # a "We are starting school tomorrow, so you should be prepared. Got everything you need?"
    a "我们明天开学，你该准备准备了吧？东西都齐了吗？"

translate schinese first_day_edf3a368:

    # mc "I was actually thinking about going shopping. I only brought a few things with me and will probably need at least a pen and notebook."
    mc "我本来打算去逛逛。我只带了几件东西，可能至少得买支笔和本笔记本。"

translate schinese first_day_654bd472:

    # a "Something to write with will certainly come in handy. Good idea."
    a "能写字的东西肯定很有用。好主意。"

translate schinese first_day_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

translate schinese first_day_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

translate schinese first_day_419d5750:

    # a "What?"
    a "怎么了？"

translate schinese first_day_d1fb73ee:

    # mc "I was hoping you would offer to keep me company."
    mc "我是在期待你说愿意陪我去。"

translate schinese first_day_b8c98d9d:

    # a "Hah, not a chance. There's an end of holidays event in my game today. I don't have time for shopping."
    a "哈，想得美。我游戏今天有期末活动，没空去逛街。"

translate schinese first_day_0224a278:

    # mc "Some game event is more important to you than me?"
    mc "某个游戏活动比你还重要？"

translate schinese first_day_9c2d2089:

    # a "What can I say? Life is brutal."
    a "我有什么办法呢，生活就是这么残酷。"

translate schinese first_day_cadcd622:

    # a "You'll be here every day and that event happens only once a year."
    a "你天天都在这儿，那个活动一年才一次。"

translate schinese first_day_25954a65:

    # a "Maybe I'll finally manage to rack up 10,000 gold."
    a "说不定这次我终于能攒到一万金币。"

translate schinese first_day_da1a39e3:

    # a "Then I'll be able to buy that awesome outfit. It looks so cool. God, whenever I think about it, I want it so badly."
    a "那样我就能买那套超酷的衣服了。真的好帅，天啊，一想到就特别想要。"

translate schinese first_day_8f7191e9:

    # mc "Okay, okay, fine. I'll ask Kate then."
    mc "好好好行吧。那我去找凯特。"

translate schinese first_day_20e67cc4:

    # a "Oh, she'll definitely go with you."
    a "哦，她肯定陪你去。"

translate schinese first_day_bb56e7ba:

    # a "She loves shopping. Plus she knows the city better than I do, so she'll be a better guide."
    a "她爱逛街，而且她比我更熟悉这座城，带路肯定比我强。"

translate schinese first_day_55143d67:

    # mc "Cool, but is she even at home?"
    mc "酷，不过她现在在家吗？"

translate schinese first_day_666d272d:

    # a "I don't know, I got up not long before you did. Haven't seen her yet."
    a "不知道，我比你没早起多久，还没看见她呢。"

translate schinese first_day_cf876380:

    # a "If she's around, she should show up any minute. It's already time for her second breakfast."
    a "她要是在的话，这会儿也该出现了。已经到吃她第二顿早饭的时间了。"

translate schinese first_day_ec902d10:

    # mc "She eats around now?"
    mc "她这个点就吃饭？"

translate schinese first_day_c67bfbfc:

    # a "You should see it for yourself in a moment."
    a "你等会儿自己看吧。"

translate schinese first_day_c2d5029f:

    # a "Hey sis."
    a "姐。"

translate schinese first_day_e30e67cc:

    # k "Hey."
    k "嗯。"

translate schinese first_day_b7397784:

    # k "Hey [mc]."
    k "[mc]，早上好。"

translate schinese first_day_b4e8bda9:

    # mc "Hey Ka-"
    mc "凯——"

translate schinese first_day_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

translate schinese first_day_eb76e659:

    # a "Oh god... See what you've done, Kate?"
    a "我的天……凯特，看看你干的好事？"

translate schinese first_day_8811966d:

    # a "I thought once there was a guy living here, you wouldn't be walking around in just your underwear anymore."
    a "我以为自从这里住过一个男的，你就不肯再只穿内衣乱走了。"

translate schinese first_day_a92def28:

    # k "Not an option. I'm at home, so I'll wear whatever I feel comfortable in."
    k "不可能。我在自己家，想穿什么舒服就穿什么。"

translate schinese first_day_3d3636b7:

    # k "Besides, [mc] got my permission already, right?"
    k "再说了，[mc] 已经拿到我的许可了，对吧？"

translate schinese first_day_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

translate schinese first_day_95615576:

    # k "Right, [mc]?"
    k "对吧，[mc]？"

translate schinese first_day_2c90f105:

    # mc "Oh... um... yes."
    mc "哦……呃……是、是的。"

translate schinese first_day_129f88f0:

    # mc "Yes, I did."
    mc "嗯，我给了。"

translate schinese first_day_943e006e:

    # a "I can't believe you two."
    a "我真服了你们两个。"

translate schinese first_day_cd1c8f58:

    # k "Come on, his reaction is hilarious. Totally worth it."
    k "得了吧，他的反应太好笑了。太值了。"

translate schinese first_day_7bfb54c1:

    # k "Besides, his reaction is hilarious."
    k "而且他的反应真的很好笑。"

translate schinese first_day_b4c5adc7:

    # a "Well, okay. I have to agree with you on that one."
    a "好吧，这点我同意你。"

translate schinese first_day_1cc6ffd7:

    # mc "Yeah, yeah, very funny."
    mc "是是是，非常好笑。"

translate schinese first_day_4ea33eb1:

    # mc "Anyway, Kate are you free today?"
    mc "话说，凯特你今天有空吗？"

translate schinese first_day_34db8f08:

