    # a "Exactly! Do you have any idea how much I'm losing out on right now?"
    a "就是！你知道我现在错过了多少吗？"

translate schinese school_start_24b6f6e4:

    # a "On top of that, they extended yesterday's event and I'm trapped here."
    a "而且活动还延长了，我被困在这儿了。"

